"\n"
"There are still marked changes that have not yet been applied. They will get "
"lost if you choose to quit 'Synaptic'."
msgstr ""
"<b><big>Quit en weggooi gemerkte veranderinge?</big></b>Daar is nog steeds "
"gemerk veranderinge wat nog nie aansoek gedoen het. Hulle sal verdwaal as jy "
"kies om quit 'Synaptic'."

